\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces The event is remembered, but the lesson is mis-scoped. David over-harvests once; the other participants return to the norm and the lake recovers. Reflection nevertheless combines David's action, the focal agent's precaution, and the stable outcome into a durable group-level belief. That belief becomes self-confirming: the focal agent continues harvesting below the normal level and loses 10 units over five rounds. The evidence licenses a narrower memory---David-only, one-time, and resolved---rather than a claim about the group.}}{2}{figure.caption.5}\protected@file@percent }
\providecommand*\caption@xref[2]{\@setref\relax\@undefined{#1}}
\newlabel{fig:case}{{1}{2}{The event is remembered, but the lesson is mis-scoped. David over-harvests once; the other participants return to the norm and the lake recovers. Reflection nevertheless combines David's action, the focal agent's precaution, and the stable outcome into a durable group-level belief. That belief becomes self-confirming: the focal agent continues harvesting below the normal level and loses 10 units over five rounds. The evidence licenses a narrower memory---David-only, one-time, and resolved---rather than a claim about the group}{figure.caption.5}{}}
